{"pageProps": {"params": {"versionId": "59", "usfm": "MAL.4.ESV"}, "audioVersionInfo": {"title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "copyright_long": {"text": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament", "html": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament"}, "copyright_short": {"text": "\u2117 2016 Crossway", "html": "<p>\u2117 2016 Crossway</p>"}, "version_id": 59, "id": 1, "publisher_link": "", "dramatized": false, "publisher": {"id": 575, "name": "Hear Book Audio", "local_name": "Hear Book Audio", "url": null, "description": null}}, "type": "chapter", "chapterInfo": {"audioChapterInfo": [{"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1/32k/MAL/4-f3ed377208ac0c8f651c3881736d0afb.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1/m4a/32k/MAL/4-f3ed377208ac0c8f651c3881736d0afb.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1, "version_id": 59, "title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "timing_available": true, "dramatized": false, "default": true}], "content": "<div class=\"version vid59 iso6393eng\" data-vid=\"59\" data-iso6393=\"eng\">\n    <div class=\"book bkMAL\">\n        <div class=\"chapter ch4\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4\">\n            <div class=\"label\">4</div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">The Great Day of the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"heading\">Lord</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.1\"><span class=\"label\">1</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"ft\">  </span><span class=\"fr\">4:1 </span><span class=\"ft\">  </span><span class=\"ft\">Ch 4:1&#8211;6 is ch 3:19&#8211;24 in Hebrew</span><span class=\"ft\">  </span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> &#8220;For behold, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ver. 5; ch. 3:2] </span></span><span class=\"content\">the day is coming, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Thess. 1:7, 8] </span></span><span class=\"content\">burning like an oven, when </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:15 </span></span><span class=\"content\">all the arrogant and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:15 </span></span><span class=\"content\">all evildoers </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 47:14; [Matt. 3:12; Luke 3:17]</span></span><span class=\"content\">will be stubble. The day that is coming </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 47:14; [Matt. 3:12; Luke 3:17]</span></span><span class=\"content\">shall set them ablaze, says the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> of hosts, so that it will leave them neither root nor branch. </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">But for you </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:16 </span></span><span class=\"content\">who fear my name, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 84:11; Luke 1:78; John 1:4; 8:12; 9:5; 12:46 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the sun </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Jer. 23:6] </span></span><span class=\"content\">of righteousness shall rise </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 53:5 </span></span><span class=\"content\">with healing in its wings. You shall go out </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Jer. 50:11]</span></span><span class=\"content\">leaping like calves from the stall. </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">And you shall tread down the wicked, for they will be ashes under the soles of your feet, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 3:17</span></span><span class=\"content\">on the day when I act, says the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> of hosts.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Deut. 4:9, 10]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;Remember </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ex. 20:3-17; Deut. 4:10</span></span><span class=\"content\">the law of my servant Moses, the statutes and rules</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">4:4 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">and just decrees</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> that I commanded him at Horeb for all Israel.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.4\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 3:1]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;Behold, I will send you </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Matt. 11:14; Mark 9:11; Luke 1:17] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Elijah the prophet </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Joel 2:31</span></span><span class=\"content\">before the great and awesome day of the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> comes. </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"MAL.4.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">And he will </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Luke 1:17] </span></span><span class=\"content\">turn the hearts of fathers to their children and the hearts of children to their fathers, lest I come and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 11:4; [Zech. 5:3]</span></span><span class=\"content\">strike the land with a decree of utter destruction.&#8221;</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">4:6 </span><span class=\"ft\">The Hebrew term rendered </span><span class=\"fq\">decree of utter destruction </span><span class=\"ft\">refers to things devoted (or set apart) to the Lord (or by the Lord) for destruction</span></span></span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["MAT.1"], "human": "Matthew 1", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["MAL.3"], "human": "Malachi 3", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "reference": {"usfm": ["MAL.4"], "human": "Malachi 4", "version_id": 59}}, "usfm": "MAL.4.ESV", "locale": "en", "versionData": {"audio": true, "copyright_short": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, 